[1] NUMERIC key, ta.cd = 5: idx-join, outer iscan tb, inner iscan ta on i_ta_ka     

===================================================
count(*)    
200     

Query plan:
idx-join (inner join)
    outer: iscan
               class: tb node[?]
               index: i_tb_cd term[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    inner: iscan
               class: ta node[?]
               index: i_ta_ka term[?]
               sargs: term[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select count(*) from ta ta, tb tb where ta.ka=tb.ka and tb.cd= ?:?  and ta.cd= ?:? 
